	(text "SAFETY  fuse F101 T4A slow-blow (toroid inrush!), NTC RT101 limits inrush, MOV RV101 + X2 cap C101 + CM choke FL101 = mains filter.\n  Bleeders R102/R103 discharge the 6600 uF bank (~60 s). Bridge D101 needs a heatsink (~8 W at 5 A).  HV_DC and AUX_12V outputs are isolated from mains\n  (transformer / IRM-10-12) and are NOT tied to PowerStage GND here: connect them only through J102 -> PowerStage J1 and J103 -> AuxUsb J5."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2b23708f-066e-4d55-a149-4d1b9053fd31")
	)
	(text "MAINS SIDE - 230 VAC / 50 Hz.  Lethal voltages: keep >= 6 mm creepage between mains and everything else, fuse and switch the live and neutral, bond PE to the chassis."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 5.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "70a82e1f-9290-4413-b7af-df2b72d30e17")
	)
	(text "TRANSFORMER  230V : 2 x 45V, 500 VA toroid (windings in SERIES = 90 Vrms; centre tap unused).\n  e.g. Vigortronix VTX-146-500-145 (Rapid, 230V single primary) or RS PRO 123-4044 (2x115V primaries: wire in series for 230V).\n  500 VA => ~330-360 W continuous DC into a capacitor-input rectifier; 500 W only for short bursts. For 500 W continuous use 800 VA (2x45V).\nBUS  no-load ~134 V peak, ~118-125 V at full load, ripple ~7 V pp with 2 x 3300 uF; 100 V out at 5 A needs >= ~112 V at the bottom of the ripple.\n  At +10 % mains the no-load bus reaches ~148 V: PowerStage D1 (SMCJ130CA) starts to conduct above ~144 V -> consider SMCJ150A there."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f1248099-db34-4fdf-8c77-cca3d1a30eba")
	)
